  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#the-rules-for-choosing-a-navigable checks for the transient activation without consuming it. Chromium seems to consume the transient activation in both `<a target=\"_blank\">` and `window.open` cases per result of [test](https://codepen.io/edgarchen-the-decoder/pen/bGZaZgO). Gecko only consumes the activation in `window.open` case. Webkit doesn't consume the activation in either case.",
